*.[Tt][Mm][Pp]
*.[Tt][Mm][Pp].*
*.[Tt][Ee][Mm][Pp]
*.[Tt][Ee][Mm][Pp].*
[Tt][Mm][Pp]-*
[Tt][Mm][Pp]_*
